WEBVTT

00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:02.020
Five!

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:03.100
Four!

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.310
Three!

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:05.310
Two!

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:06.690
One!

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:08.230
Zero!

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:19.120
Thank you, girls.

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:24.830
These illuminations will help soothe the spirits of Kibougahana this Christmas.{lit "ILLUMINATE KIBOUGAHANA WITH RELAXING LIGHT UNTIL CHRISTMAS" thx japanese}

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:43.020
I want to meet the Precure! - Mayuka

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:46.230
HeartCatch

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:47.690
Precure!

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:51.280
HeartCatch Precure!

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:54.240
Now, all together

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:56.750
HeartCatch Precure!

00:00:56.910 --> 00:00:59.750
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:07.330
Within each of our chests,

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:10.000
they begin to sprout

00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:11.670
The seeds of the heart

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:12.960
are growing

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.590
bit by bit

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:16.260
Red,

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:16.880
white

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:18.180
and yellow

00:01:18.350 --> 00:01:20.890
It's because these blooming buds are

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:22.350
all varied colors

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:23.820
that they

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:26.020
shine so brightly!

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:31.320
That smile that you've nurtured

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:33.810
with such care

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:36.530
will never wither

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:40.160
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:43.040
Now, all together

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:45.500
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:45.670 --> 00:01:48.170
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:01:48.550 --> 00:01:53.050
They're always right by our sides

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:53.880
So together

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:57.720
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:00.680
bloom even more!

00:02:00.850 --> 00:02:02.230
HeartCatch

00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:03.740
Precure!

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:15.940
A Christmas Miracle<i>!</i>

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:15.940
A Christmas Miracle<i>!</i>

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:27.750
Tsubomi!

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:29.940
Gimme a lift up!

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:31.160
Whoa!

00:02:31.970 --> 00:02:33.630
Here we go!

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:37.800
Come on! We're nearly there!

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:40.130
What's it say?

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:43.380
"I want to meet the Precure," huh?

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:44.850
Don't look!

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:55.660
Are you okay?

00:02:58.540 --> 00:03:00.280
You're Mayuka, right?

00:03:01.850 --> 00:03:05.470
Your dad's Mr. Tachibana from the botanical gardens, isn't he?

00:03:07.590 --> 00:03:10.380
Is that your wish written up there?

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:13.580
Yeah.

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:20.550
You should be asking for Christmas presents
 from Santa! Save wishes like that for Tanabata!

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:24.430
I don't care about presents.

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:28.080
Mayuka?!

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:33.670
Did we make her cry?

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:37.780
She wants to meet the Precure.

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:38.990
Yeah.

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:41.520
Quite badly, by the looks of it.

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:52.030
I hope I can find Mayuka.

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:06.320
You're lying!

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:07.560
I'm not lying!

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:10.270
The Precure are my friends!

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:11.540
Really?

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:14.030
Of course not! She's a total fibber!

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:21.120
Mayuka, haven't our teachers always said it's wrong to lie?

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:23.200
I-I'm not lying!

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:26.490
I was playing with the Precure last night!

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:29.870
Then let us meet them too!

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:33.960
Yeah, see, she's lying!

00:04:37.050 --> 00:04:37.960
Okay.

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:40.800
I'll let you meet them!

00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:46.390
You mean it?

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:47.260
When?

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:53.390
F-Five P.M., on Christmas Eve, by 
the Christmas tree in the gardens!

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:39.820
Hello there.

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:42.630
H-Hello...

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:52.580
You were at the gardens with us last night.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:57.250
So that promise you made to your friends about the Precure...

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:04.010
Why are you lying to them like that?

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:08.550
I'm not lying!

00:06:09.060 --> 00:06:13.430
I know... I know the Precure will come!

00:06:23.060 --> 00:06:26.070
Mayuka told you that, did she?

00:06:26.540 --> 00:06:29.110
I'm sorry for all this bother.

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:33.080
It's all right, really. I was the one who went to ask her.

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:37.000
Her teachers have warned me about her behavior as of late.

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:41.330
She's been telling numerous lies to the other kids lately.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:43.960
At first, it was just trivial little things.

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:48.640
But now, it's reached the point where she's been claiming her mother's an actress,

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:50.640
or that we're incredibly rich.

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:56.680
The problem is, she's not good at making friends.

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:59.920
She's very shy around new people.

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:02.810
Just like you when you were young, Tsubomi.

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:04.280
Yeah.

00:07:04.280 --> 00:07:10.050
I'm sure she's only telling these lies so people pay attention to her.

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:52.150
When I was your age, Mayuka, I was so shy I couldn't make any friends at all.

00:07:55.060 --> 00:07:58.990
Tsubomi, why don't you go and play with the other kids?

00:08:01.070 --> 00:08:04.460
You'll never make any friends unless you do.

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:07.340
I don't want to!

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:12.010
The flowers are my friends!

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:13.270
Aren't you?

00:08:16.150 --> 00:08:17.210
So I know

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:21.520
how you must be feeling.

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:28.150
But I never, ever told lies.

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:37.370
And I doubt the Precure would want to meet someone who tells lies to people.

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:42.200
See, the thing is...

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:45.120
I'm friends with the Precure!

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:47.840
Yep. Yep!

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:58.100
You're lying!

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:00.080
No, I'm not!

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:03.970
My friend's a Precure! I mean, the Precure are my friends!

00:09:03.970 --> 00:09:07.860
I'm serious! Please! You've got to believe me!

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:21.870
Hey, miss.

00:09:22.170 --> 00:09:24.110
Sis?!{i know this is really fucking flimsy and might come across more as an editing mistake than anything but I'm not sure how else to handle it? like Tsubomi being way too excited about being ~big sis~ is too important to miss out on but aaaaaaaaa}

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:26.560
Did you say sis?

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:28.830
Ah, what a lovely sound.

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:29.630
Yes?

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:35.660
If I promise not to lie again, do you
 think the Precure will come see me?

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:36.930
Of course they will!

00:09:37.940 --> 00:09:40.260
Then I won't tell any more lies!

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:43.380
It's a promise, then?

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:44.140
Yeah!

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:47.520
What?

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:50.110
You really promised her that?

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:52.270
Please, make her dream come true!

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:54.190
That's just like you.

00:09:54.590 --> 00:09:55.870
Sure, I'll help.

00:09:56.680 --> 00:09:58.410
I will also assist.

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:01.560
Aww, fine.

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:02.740
Guess I'll help.

00:10:03.340 --> 00:10:07.840
Thank you, thank you, thank you!

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:13.460
It's Christmas Eve, ladies and gents!

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:15.970
Why not take home a lovely Christmas cake?

00:10:18.820 --> 00:10:20.570
I wish I had a girlfriend.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:22.510
But it's okay!

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:24.850
Because I love the Precure!

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:26.060
Love?

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:27.390
The Precure?

00:10:29.490 --> 00:10:30.920
Wh-Who are you?!

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:32.800
The Flower of your Heart...

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:34.860
...is wilting nicely!

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:41.830
Flower of the Heart, show yourself!

00:10:49.510 --> 00:10:53.200
Desertrian, that's your cue!

00:11:21.670 --> 00:11:24.160
Itsuki sure is late.

00:11:24.570 --> 00:11:26.280
It's nearly five!

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:28.080
Bad newsh!

00:11:29.360 --> 00:11:31.670
There'sh a Deshertrian in town!

00:11:32.530 --> 00:11:34.920
Sunshine's fighting it all by hershelf!

00:11:35.350 --> 00:11:36.490
What should we do?!

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:37.910
The obvious.

00:11:37.910 --> 00:11:40.510
Our priority is protecting people.

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:43.020
Come on.

00:11:43.020 --> 00:11:44.260
B-But...

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:45.600
We have to go.

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:50.430
Mayuka...

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:56.070
I hate lovey-dovey couples!{might be worth noting on the blog or something that Christmas is more of a lovers holiday in Japan than a family one? idk}

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:58.630
And I hate Christmas!

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:10.080
Precure Gold Forte Burst!

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:19.960
Bearing the burden yourself today, I see.

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:26.930
Give up while you still can!

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:34.100
Sunshine.

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:35.480
This time, you're finished!

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:44.470
Winning a fight two versus one is hardly anything to be proud of.

00:12:52.380 --> 00:12:56.870
Precure Christmas Impact!

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:03.810
Christmas...

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:06.220
A Desertrian is, alas, no match.

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:08.550
Then let's show them what we can do.

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:10.910
Dark Bracelets!

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:23.110
Behold, the power of a Desertrian 
with two commanders at the helm!

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:24.990
Take this!

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:32.280
And now, this!

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:40.870
This is our Christmas present to you all!

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:26.500
The Precure will come, won't they?

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:29.130
She was lying after all!

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:33.350
They'll come!

00:14:33.630 --> 00:14:36.430
I know the Precure will come!

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:41.710
Coupe. 

00:14:41.710 --> 00:14:45.080
I'd like to give Mayuka a little Christmas present.

00:14:47.250 --> 00:14:51.940
I want you to help me and help Tsubomi and her friends.

00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:56.330
Blossom!

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:58.480
Please, wake up!

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:01.670
The Precure are finished!

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:03.380
Hold on now.

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:06.740
We can save the main course for later.

00:15:06.740 --> 00:15:09.100
I suggest a little appetizer first.

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:13.640
So we run wild and wilt the Flowers of some more human Hearts?

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:14.470
Let's do it!

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:19.240
Oh?

00:15:19.240 --> 00:15:21.080
Let's ruin that!

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:23.130
Let's go home.

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:35.410
If we wreck this tree, who knows how many Flowers it'll wilt?!

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:38.950
Say  your prayers!

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:39.660
I want to meet the Precure! - Mayuka

00:16:00.220 --> 00:16:01.730
A Precure?

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:04.730
A Precure?!

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:25.480
Whoa!

00:16:25.480 --> 00:16:27.610
But which Precure is that?

00:16:27.610 --> 00:16:30.860
She's not Cure Blossom or Cure Marine.

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:34.340
I am...

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:35.830
You're?

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:41.170
A lone flower, radiant in the holy light!

00:16:44.880 --> 00:16:46.440
Cure Flower!

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:51.980
Cure Flower?!

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:56.200
The legendary Precure that defeated King Dune?!

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:59.180
Very well! Bring it on!

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:02.290
Take Mayuka and her friends to safety.

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:05.170
Take this! Blizzard Blast!

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:16.010
Precure Flower Candle!

00:17:25.220 --> 00:17:28.360
Precure Flower Carnival!

00:17:56.580 --> 00:17:58.990
This is about all I can manage now.

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:02.220
I doubt I could even pull off a Forte Wave.

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:04.730
Let's go help the others, okay?

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:15.040
Flowers of our Hearts,

00:18:15.950 --> 00:18:18.490
release the Precure from their prison!

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:25.850
Cure Flower!

00:18:25.850 --> 00:18:27.150
We can talk later.

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:28.830
I'll leave him to you.

00:18:37.360 --> 00:18:40.850
Mirror, o mirror, grant we Precure your power!

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:11.370
The shining flowers illuminating the world.

00:19:12.520 --> 00:19:17.350
HeartCatch Precure: Super Silhouettes!

00:19:22.790 --> 00:19:24.930
Flowers, bloom tall!

00:19:29.220 --> 00:19:33.470
Precure HeartCatch Orchestra!

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:09.590
We'll get you for this!

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:25.370
Cure Blossom

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:25.370
Cure Sunshine

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:25.370
Cure Flower

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:25.370
Cure
Moonlight

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:25.370
Cure Marine

00:20:24.380 --> 00:20:25.370
Grandma!

00:20:26.390 --> 00:20:27.370
My, my!

00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:30.960
Blossom's such a softie!

00:20:34.860 --> 00:20:38.020
We're sorry we called you a liar, Mayuka!

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:40.260
Don't say sorry.

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:44.800
But wow, you really are friends with the Precure!

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:51.270
No, I'm not.

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:53.980
I was lying.

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:58.060
The Precure just answered my wish.

00:20:58.850 --> 00:21:02.930
I never wanted to tell such a big lie.

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:07.680
I just wanted you all to want to be friends with me.

00:21:07.680 --> 00:21:08.870
I'm sorry.

00:21:10.460 --> 00:21:12.530
What're you saying, Mayuka?

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:17.960
We've always thought of you as our friend! Right?

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:18.960
Yeah!

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:37.000
I didn't expect your grandma to transform, though!

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:39.070
You can call me Cure Flower, dear!

00:21:42.550 --> 00:21:43.690
Grandma?

00:21:45.320 --> 00:21:46.410
You!

00:21:50.240 --> 00:21:52.790
It's been too long, Cure Flower.

00:21:53.150 --> 00:21:54.110
Dune!

00:21:55.340 --> 00:21:56.540
He's...

00:21:56.540 --> 00:21:58.410
the Desert King?!

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:18.020
So come on, let's sing together in harmony!

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:22.190
Come on, all together now!

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:25.690
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:27.070 --> 00:22:32.660
When you give life your all, within your heart

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:38.250
a shining flower begins to bloom

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:47.220
So when you feel like crying, raise your head

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:53.930
and you'll see everyone's there by your side!

00:22:54.810 --> 00:22:59.980
So let's dance together, hand in hand!

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:04.400
All those

00:23:04.560 --> 00:23:08.980
happy feelings will be shared amongst us!

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:14.240
Lose yourself is the melody!

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:16.910
Yay, yay, hey!

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:21.130
And tomorrow will bring even more Hallelujahs!

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:27.260
So come on! Let's make the Flowers of our Hearts bloom!

00:23:28.880 --> 00:23:31.300
With all our might!

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:34.640
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:37.810
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:45.880
<i>A wind of despair is blowing across our dessicated world.</i>

00:23:45.880 --> 00:23:47.490
<i>Is there no hope left?</i>

00:23:47.490 --> 00:23:49.390
<i>Is there no future for us?</i>

00:23:49.390 --> 00:23:51.320
<i>We've fought so hard as Precure, though!</i>

00:23:51.320 --> 00:23:52.570
<i>It can't end like this!</i>

00:23:52.980 --> 00:23:55.740
<i>But the Great Heart Tree's wilted too!</i>

00:23:55.740 --> 00:23:57.240
<i>Don't give up hope!</i>

00:23:57.700 --> 00:24:01.080
<i>It's our duty as Precure to keep fighting!</i>

00:24:01.790 --> 00:24:03.460
HeartCatch Precure<i>:</i>

00:24:03.460 --> 00:24:06.670
It's All Over...

00:24:03.460 --> 00:24:06.670
It's All Over...

00:24:06.670 --> 00:24:08.590
<i>We'll catch everyone's hearts!</i>
